        "title": "Ai nangkai khang suni",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ai nangkai khang suni gaimei le banthaimei,",
            "Abumang lung khang kauh thu 7#@;",
            "Ndap tarimei mak tingkauh kandih khou 7#@,",
            "Tingsang takpui ram gai khou (2).",
            "",
            "2. Tingkau gaimei ram7#@ amang thang dukhou man,",
            "Neila tak dat mak pui ram me;",
            "Du makkhe tauhei mu ramgai mei 7#@ guang khang,",
            "Akhang rui kai gaimei nai e (2).",
            "",
            "3. Hei kai 7#@ akhang rana ram me nang khang ni,",
            "Naz’ret Jisu lung pui ram me;",
            "Tingsang lung khang hei ram 7#@ adi gaini cho?",
            "Jisu rui liu lou pui ramme (2).",
            "",
            "4. Hei ram khou kai 7#@ karam gai sangam makge,",
            "Khou 7#@ lung rianramei mak khe;",
            "Neilamei le khuan gaimei luh rana suanna,",
            "Kapum ma hou lou ngam puni (2).",
            "",
            "5. Guang o apuchai thiu, lung neilana guang o,",
            "Tat dikho hei ram gaimei thang;",
            "Jaujian loumei pu aniu ta duanga lung ni,",
            "Lung rinara nai dat mak pui ram khou (2).",
            "Lung rianra pingmei guai nai lak khe hei khou 7#@,",
            "Nai lak khe mikdui kei datmei."
          ]
        }
      }
